{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re Santa. You bowl. The elves mock you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jingle Strike VR</strong> is the world\u2019s jolliest virtual reality bowling game. Bowl strikes across Christmas themed alleys while snarky elves wander around, cheer your wins, and mock your fails. You can throw stuff at them. They\u2019ll fart. Sometimes they giggle. It\u2019s Christmas magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or pass the headset for chaotic couch VR with up to 5 players. Imagine how much fun Christmas day will be when granny plays! Just don\u2019t take this all too seriously \u2014 the elves certainly won\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941080?t=1760570013","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/a5bef36f96035724acb5e401648d796a1525ee7e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760570013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/6b921c87fe5a0eba491e3a454307fbd76bbdd8eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760570013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/6b921c87fe5a0eba491e3a454307fbd76bbdd8eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760570013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re Santa. You bowl. The elves mock you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jingle Strike VR</strong> is the world\u2019s jolliest virtual reality bowling game. Bowl strikes across Christmas themed alleys while snarky elves wander around, cheer your wins, and mock your fails. You can throw stuff at them. They\u2019ll fart. Sometimes they giggle. It\u2019s Christmas magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or pass the headset for chaotic couch VR with up to 5 players. Imagine how much fun Christmas day will be when granny plays! Just don\u2019t take this all too seriously \u2014 the elves certainly won\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Spooky Pictures Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/81f73fd4f1a695ce0c2ad8784c9ee4c92f94088b/header.jpg?t=1760570013","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Spooky Pictures. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941080/1846935449/ad2984f503474a81278803b69307e70a1d1d0058/1758259123/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760570011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941080/1846935449/ad2984f503474a81278803b69307e70a1d1d0058/1758259123/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760570011","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941080/1846935449/ad2984f503474a81278803b69307e70a1d1d0058/1758259123/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760570011","id":257201824,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257201824/movie480.mp4?t=1760570011","max":"https://video.akam